{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42935","headline":"观兄弟同夜成婚 · 郑轨","name":"观兄弟同夜成婚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"棠棣开双萼，夭桃照两花。\n分庭含佩响，隔扇偶妆华。\n迎风俱似雪，映绮共如霞。\n今宵二神女，幷在一仙家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑轨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}